# L §6.4 (round 11b): "from D is the day the branch diverges: no scenario row of an item the base declares governs a
# day before D (LOAD-SCENARIO). A row of an input the scenario declares may govern always ..., since only the scenario
# reads it." child's version governs 2026.., before its from 2027-01-01, but its row is of benefit_amt, which child
# declares: child loads. In March 2027 ana and ola (from 2027-03-01) each get the gift (2 x 100.00) and ola the
# benefit (50.00): b = 250.00 PLN. child2's version replaces gift_amt, a base input, from 2026: child2 is refused,
# the base runs (L §8.3).
# Over the base of L6_4_scenario_stack (a gift of 100.00 PLN to each person monthly into konto) and its scenario
# child (a hypothetical child ola, a benefit move), with one change each.
=== household.tally
model household
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2030-12-31

source plan "plan"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons
kind gifts: event certain
  leg cash: PLN
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2019-05-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input gift_amt: money PLN
input gift_dom: int

move gift[m in months, p in persons on day_of(m, gift_dom)]: gifts
  on day_of(m, gift_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount gift_amt

version plan_2026
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ana] lives 1990-04-02..
  gift_amt = 100.00 PLN "own"
  gift_dom = 5 "own"
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "wyciąg"

ask c1: count(p in persons on 2027-06-01)
=== child.tally
scenario child over household
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01
  note "a child in March 2027"

input benefit_amt: money PLN
move benefit[m in months, p in persons on day_of(m, gift_dom)]: gifts
  on day_of(m, gift_dom)
  at start_of(m)
  when p == ola
  leg cash from world to konto amount benefit_amt

version ola_born
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-10-15
  persons + [ola] lives 2027-03-01..
  benefit_amt = 50.00 PLN "benefit act"

ask b: flows(konto, 2027-03) in child
=== child2.tally
scenario child2 over household
  tally 2
  from 2027-01-01

version more
  cite plan
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-10-15
  replace gift_amt = 150.00 PLN "own"
=== expect
scenario child2: refused: LOAD-SCENARIO a row of child2 for gift_amt, an item of the base, governs a day before 2027-01-01 (child2.tally:9)
b: 250.00 PLN
...
c1: 1
  cut 2026-10-20
